      "content": "Feeling like a burden doesn't change the fact that humans are capable of profound growth and redemption through genuine remorse and action. You may not be the person you want to be right now, but no soul is inherently incapable of being fixed or making amends with love and effort. Please reach out to a mental health professional who can help you navigate this darkness without judgment, because even the heaviest burdens can be shared in a way that allows healing to begin.",
